ds4 (antirez's ds4.c)
https://github.com/antirez/ds4

  Licensed under the MIT License, whose full text, with ds4's copyright
  lines, follows this entry.

  ds4's license also carries the ggml authors' copyright, which covers the
  GGUF block layouts and the IQ2_XXS grid tables below.

  lily serves GLM 5.3 Flash from ds4's published GGUF and follows ds4's
  implementation of the model: the graph (src/glm53/), the GGUF block
  formats and their value formulas including the IQ2_XXS grid and sign
  tables (src/gguf.rs, src/kernels/vulkan/glm53_quant.glsl,
  glm53_iq2xxs_grid.glsl), and these kernels in
  src/kernels/vulkan/glm53.comp, ported from ds4's Metal sources:

    glm53_kda_decode, glm53_kda_prefill_prepare / _recurrence / _output
      metal/glm53_kda.metal (from the kimi-k3 branch)
    glm53_indexer_pool_update
      metal/dsv4_misc.metal, kernel_glm53_indexer_pool_update
    the Sinkhorn split of glm53_hc_pre / glm53_hc_pre2
      ds4.c, hc_split_sinkhorn_one

  tools/reference/glm53/gguf_dequant_golden.c computes its golden values
  with ds4's formulas and quantizer (gguf-tools/quants.c).

  lily serves DeepSeek V4 Flash from ds4's published GGUF and its DSpark
  support file, and follows ds4's implementation of the model (ds4.c):
  the shape checks (src/deepseek4/config.rs: DS4_SHAPE_FLASH,
  config_validate_deepseek4_model, validate_compress_ratio_metadata,
  validate_swiglu_clamp_metadata), the tensor schema
  (src/deepseek4/schema.rs: weights_bind_layer, weights_validate_layout),
  the graph and its CPU reference (src/deepseek4/model.rs, reference.rs:
  layer_forward_raw_swa_one, layer_attention_mixed_one,
  layer_grouped_out_one, output_hc_head_one), the tokenizer's split rules
  and stop tokens (src/deepseek4/tokenizer.rs: bpe_tokenize_text,
  vocab_load), and the DSpark drafter and its draft scheduler
  (src/deepseek4/dspark.rs, engine.rs: metal_graph_eval_dspark_stage_block,
  metal_graph_seed_dspark_stage_target_cache,
  metal_graph_eval_dspark_base_logits, metal_graph_dspark_capture_hc,
  dspark_markov_q8_0_argmax, dspark_eval_confidence_probe,
  ds4_dspark_scheduler_*). The chat template is read from the GGUF; the
  DSML tool-call parser (src/serve/tools.rs) is lily's own, written to the
  template's format. These kernels in src/kernels/vulkan/deepseek4.comp,
  dispatched by src/kernels/deepseek4.rs, are ported from ds4.c and its
  Metal sources (metal/dsv4_kv.metal, dsv4_rope.metal, dsv4_hc.metal):

    ds4_kv_store, the FP8 KV round trip
      dsv4_fp8_kv_quantize_row_inplace_cpu, kernel_dsv4_kv_fp8_store_f32
    ds4_indexer_q and the indexer rows of ds4_comp_pool, Hadamard and FP4
      dsv4_indexer_qat_row_inplace_cpu, kernel_dsv4_indexer_hadamard_fp4_f32
    ds4_comp_pool, ds4_comp_ring
      compressor_decode_one, compressor_pool_decode_state
    ds4_head_norm_rope (RoPE of the head tails with YaRN, and its inverse)
      rope_tail_ext_inplace, rope_tail_layer_inplace
    ds4_indexer_scores, ds4_topk
      indexer_allowed_decode_one
    ds4_attend (sink attention over raw and compressed rows, and DSpark's
      non-causal block)
      layer_attention_mixed_one, kernel_dsv4_flash_attn_*,
      ds4_gpu_attention_noncausal_raw_batch_heads_tensor
    ds4_router (sqrt-softplus scores, hash routing)
      layer_router_probs_one, layer_hash_selected_experts,
      layer_topk_selected_experts_from_probs
    ds4_out_collapse, ds4_hc_capture
      output_hc_head_one, kernel_dsv4_output_hc_weights4,
      metal_graph_dspark_capture_hc
    ds4_markov_prep
      dspark_eval_confidence_probe

  tools/reference/deepseek4/ops_golden.c compiles ds4's own functions out
  of ds4.c to compute its golden values.

  lily also serves Qwen3.8-Flash-Next from ds4's published Q2 GGUF
  (src/qwen4exp/gguf.rs, src/kernels/qwen_gguf.rs,
  src/kernels/vulkan/qwen_gguf*.comp): the file's layout as ds4's converter
  (gguf-tools/qwen4_exp_convert.py, on llama.cpp's conversion/qwen4exp.py
  and qwen.py, MIT, the ggml authors) writes it, which the loader undoes
  (the GDN value-head reorder, folded norms, -exp(A_log), the padded Q2_K
  down rows, the draft head's eh_proj), the MXFP4 decoder (ggml's
  dequantize_row_mxfp4), and ds4's no-thinking chat prompt for scoring its
  official continuation fixtures (src/bin/lily-qwen38.rs).

